Inclusion Criteria:

* Age between 18 and 65 years;
* Cervical pain.
* Presence of an active PGM in the upper trapezius muscle.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Traumatic history in the cervical region;
* Inability to understand or perform the required exercises;
