3. For vaccinated and CHIV RT-PCR positive individuals, have no valid sequencing result available for RT-PCR positive samples collected within 30 days post-vaccination;
4. Have the first CHIKV-like symptom onset less than 14 days from date of vaccination.

Inclusion Criteria:

